(73,'App\\Models\\User',1,'created','App\\Models\\Protocol',1,'[]','{"Title":"Montelukast 4 mg and 5 mg Chewable Tablets","Purpose":"This protocol defines the procedure to conduct Stability Studies for Montelukast 4 mg and 5 mg Chewable Tablets.","Scope":"The scope of this study confines to stability execution of submission batches manufactured in ACI HealthCare Limited.","Reference":"SOP of Stability Designing and Handling of Stability Protocol (000000650).","Responsibilities":"QC is responsible for:\\r\\n\\u2022\\tPreparation and review of stability protocol.\\r\\n\\u2022\\tCollecting and storing stability samples.\\r\\n\\u2022\\tLabeling of samples.\\r\\n\\u2022\\tInitiation and withdrawal of samples.\\r\\n\\u2022\\tPerform stability analysis.\\r\\n\\u2022\\tPreparation of analysis report and trend data.\\r\\n\\u2022\\tInitiating out-of-trend and out-of-specification investigation related to stability analysis (on requisite).\\r\\n\\u2022\\tInitiating change control, deviation\\/incident related to stability analysis.\\r\\n\\r\\nVD&LCM is responsible for:\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u2022\\tReview of stability protocol.\\r\\n\\r\\nRA is responsible for:\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u2022\\tReview of stability protocol.\\r\\n\\r\\nQA is responsible for:\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u2022\\tReview and approval of the protocol.","ProductID":"1","MarketID":"1","ManufacturerID":"1","AnalysisReport":"Analysis will be done as per stability specification and results shall be reported as per respective SOP (Testing and Reporting Result of Stability sample). Stability analysis should be initiated within 10 working days from the date of withdrawal and the analysis to be completed within 30 working days.","Reporting":"The laboratory raw data shall be reviewed and test results are to be evaluated against the established acceptance criteria. Stability trend analysis shall be reviewed as part of periodic product quality evaluation.","Conclusion":"At the end of the accelerated, intermediate and long term stability study a summary report shall be prepared with the conclusion on the stability under the packing conditions and terminate the stability study.","RevisionHistory":"New Document","CreatedBy":1,"ProtocolID":1}','https://app.acibd.com/acihc/protocols','192.168.99.2','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/103.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2022-07-19 11:23:50','2022-07-19 11:23:50'),
