st the established acceptance criteria. Stability trend analysis shall be reviewed as part of periodic product quality evaluation.","Conclusion":"At the end of the accelerated, intermediate and long term stability study a summary report shall be prepared with the conclusion on the stability under the packing conditions and terminate the stability study.","RevisionHistory":"New Revision","CreatedBy":10009,"Note":"<p>*The Placebo should be subjected to stability studies for the \\u201c<strong>Related substances test<\\/strong>\\u201d. This Placebo should be used for all strengths (600 mg &amp; 800 mg). The Placebo samples should be withdrawn at each regular time interval.<\\/p>","ProtocolID":25}','https://apps.mis.digital/acihc/protocols','192.168.99.2','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/125.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2024-05-29 02:19:16','2024-05-29 02:19:16'),
