(31057,'App\\Models\\User',10009,'created','App\\Models\\Protocol',85,'[]','{"Title":"PROT_Olmesatan Medoxomil & Hydrochlorothiazied Tablet 20\\/12.5 mg","Purpose":"To conduct stability study of Olmesatan Medoxomil & Hydrochlorothiazied Tablet 20\\/12.5 mg","Scope":"<p>qwe<\\/p>","Reference":"SOP of Stability Designing and Handling of Stability Protocol (000000650).","ProtocolStatusID":1,"FooterSectionNo":"000000123","Responsibilities":"<p><strong>QC is responsible for:<\\/strong><\\/p><ul><li>Preparation and review of stability protocol.<\\/li><li>Collecting and storing stability samples as per respective SOP.<\\/li><li>Labeling of samples.<\\/li><li>Initiation and withdrawal of samples.<\\/li><li>Perform stability analysis.<\\/li><li>Preparation of analysis report and trend data.<\\/li><li>Initiating out-of-trend&nbsp;and out-of-specification investigation related to stability analysis (on requisite).<\\/li><li>Initiating change control, deviation\\/incident related to stability analysis (on requisite).<\\/li><\\/ul><p><strong>VD &amp; LCM is responsible for:<\\/strong><\\/p><ul><li>Review of stability protocol.<\\/li><\\/ul><p><strong>RA is responsible for:<\\/strong><\\/p><ul><li>Review of stability protocol.<\\/li><\\/ul><p><strong>QA is responsible for:<\\/strong><\\/p><ul><li>Review and approval of the protocol.<\\/li><li>Sample provide to QC for stability study initiation.<\\/li><li>Protocol distribution to QC department.<\\/li><\\/ul>","ProductID":"22","MarketID":"4","ManufacturerID":"2","AnalysisReport":"Analysis will be done as per stability specification and results shall be reported as per respective SOP (Testing and Reporting Result of Stability sample). Stability sample withdrawal from respective stability chambers for testing in sampling due date as (+2 working days from due date for up to 6 months, +5 working days from due date for 9 and 12 months, within +10 working days after 18 months and later time points). Stability analysis should be initiated within 10 working days from the date of withdrawal and the analysis to be completed within 30 working days after starting of analysis.","Reporting":"The laboratory raw data shall be reviewed and test results are to be evaluated against the established acceptance criteria. Stability trend analysis shall be reviewed as part of periodic product quality evaluation.","Conclusion":"At the end of the Long-term stability study a summary report shall be prepared with the conclusion on the stability under the packing conditions and terminate the stability study.","RevisionHistory":"New Document","CreatedBy":10009,"Note":"<p>asaad<\\/p>","ProtocolID":85}','https://wa.acibd.com/acihc/protocols','192.168.102.1','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/134.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2025-03-10 05:11:35','2025-03-10 05:11:35'),
