iew and supervise the compliance with the PSSP<\\/li><li>Is responsible for to review and supervise the compliance with the SOP<\\/li><\\/ul><p>QA is responsible for:<\\/p><ul><li>Is responsible for review and final approval and to assure adherence to the PSSP.<\\/li><li>Collection and transfer of sample from production to QC.<\\/li><li>Is responsible for review and final approval and to assure adherence to the SOP<\\/li><\\/ul>","UpdatedBy":10009}','https://wa.acibd.com/acihc/protocols/update/18','192.168.102.1','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/140.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2025-09-15 08:55:36','2025-09-15 08:55:36'),
