 +10 working days for 18 months and later time points. Stability analysis should be initiated within 10 working days from the date of withdrawal and the analysis to be completed within 30 working days from start of analysis.","Reporting":"The laboratory raw data shall be reviewed and test results are to be evaluated against the established acceptance criteria. Stability trend analysis shall be reviewed as part of periodic product quality evaluation.","Conclusion":"At the end of the Accelerated and Long-term stability study  summary report shall be prepared with the conclusion on the stability under the packing conditions and terminate the stability study.","RevisionHistory":"New revision","TestNote":null,"ExhibitBatch":"N","CommercialValidationBatch":"Y","AnnualStability":"N","Other":"N","CreatedBy":10009,"Note":"<ul><li>Additional Study Sample will be pulled out and tested only if needed.<\\/li><li>Microbial &nbsp;enumeration test and &nbsp;tests for &nbsp;specific microorganisms to be performed initially and yearly at &nbsp;25\\u00b1 2\\u00b0C \\/ 60 \\u00b1 5% RH , 30\\u00b1 2\\u00b0C \\/ 65 \\u00b1 5% RH and 30\\u00b1 2\\u00b0C \\/ 75 \\u00b1 5% RH &nbsp; &nbsp;condition.<\\/li><li>The Placebo should be subjected to stability studies for the \\u201c<strong>Organic impurities test<\\/strong>\\u201d. The Placebo samples should be withdrawn at each regular time interval.<\\/li><\\/ul>","ProtocolID":54}','https://hc.acigroup.info/protocols','192.168.102.1','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/143.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-01-06 10:49:37','2026-01-06 10:49:37'),
