orking days for 18 months and later time points. Stability analysis should be initiated within 10 working days from the date of withdrawal and the analysis to be completed within 30 working days from start of analysis.","Reporting":"The laboratory raw data shall be reviewed and test results are to be evaluated against the established acceptance criteria. Stability trend analysis shall be reviewed as part of periodic product quality evaluation.","Conclusion":"At the end of the Long-term stability study a summary report shall be prepared with the conclusion on the stability under the packing conditions and terminate the stability study.","RevisionHistory":"New Document","TestNote":null,"ExhibitBatch":"N","CommercialValidationBatch":"N","AnnualStability":"Y","Other":"N","CreatedBy":10009,"Note":"<ul><li>Additional Study Sample or Placebo will be pulled out and tested only if needed.<\\/li><li>Test to be done at the initial sample, at 6months, 12months, 24months and 36months and at the end &nbsp;of the shelf life and in every year after shelf life.<\\/li><li>Microbial &nbsp;enumeration test to be done at initial sample, at the end &nbsp;of the shelf life and in every year after shelf life.<\\/li><\\/ul>","ProtocolID":65}','https://hc.acigroup.info/protocols','192.168.102.1','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/145.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-02-25 03:14:10','2026-02-25 03:14:10'),
