 and the analysis to be completed within 30 days from the date of withdrawal.","Reporting":"The laboratory raw data shall be reviewed and test results are to be evaluated against the established acceptance criteria. Stability trend analysis shall be reviewed as part of periodic product quality evaluation.","Conclusion":"At the end of the  Long-term stability study a summary report shall be prepared with the conclusion on the stability under the packing conditions and terminate the stability study.","RevisionHistory":"New Document","TestNote":null,"ExhibitBatch":"N","CommercialValidationBatch":"N","AnnualStability":"Y","Other":"N","CreatedBy":10009,"Note":"<ol><li>Additional Study Sample &nbsp;and placebo will be pulled out and tested only if needed.<\\/li><li>Microbial test to be done at the initial sample, at the end of the shelf life and in every year after shelf life.<\\/li><\\/ol>","ProtocolID":69}','https://hc.acigroup.info/protocols','192.168.102.1','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/145.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-03-12 04:46:03','2026-03-12 04:46:03'),
