eted within 30 days from the date of withdrawal.","Reporting":"The laboratory raw data shall be reviewed and test results are to be evaluated against the established acceptance criteria. Stability trend analysis shall be reviewed as part of periodic product quality evaluation.","Conclusion":"At the end of the  Accelerated and Long-term stability study a summary report shall be prepared with the conclusion on the stability under the packing conditions and terminate the stability study.","RevisionHistory":"New Document","TestNote":null,"ExhibitBatch":"N","CommercialValidationBatch":"N","AnnualStability":"N","Other":"Y","CreatedBy":10009,"Note":"<ol><li>Submission Batch<\\/li><li>Additional Study Sample &nbsp;will be pulled out and tested only if needed.<\\/li><li>Microbial enumeration test to be performed intially and yearly at 25\\u00b0C \\u00b1 2\\u00b0C\\/60% RH \\u00b1 5% RH condition.<\\/li><\\/ol>","ProtocolID":76}','https://hc.acigroup.info/protocols','192.168.102.1','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/109.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-05 03:27:29','2026-04-05 03:27:29'),
