","MarketID":"5","ManufacturerID":"2","AnalysisReport":"Analysis will be done as per stability specification and results shall be reported as per respective SOP (Testing and Reporting Result of Stability sample). Sample for testing shall be withdrawn within +2 working days. Stability analysis should be initiated within 10 days from the date of withdrawal and the analysis to be completed within 30 days from the date of withdrawal","Reporting":"The laboratory raw data shall be reviewed and test results are to be evaluated against the established acceptance criteria. Stability trend analysis shall be reviewed as part of periodic product quality evaluation","Conclusion":"At the end of the Long-term stability study a summary report shall be prepared with the conclusion on the stability under the packing conditions and terminate the stability study","RevisionHistory":"New Document","TestNote":null,"ExhibitBatch":"N","CommercialValidationBatch":"N","AnnualStability":"Y","Other":"N","CreatedBy":10012,"Note":"<ol><li>Additional Study Sample will be pulled out and tested only if needed.<\\/li><li>Microbial&nbsp;test to be done at the initial sample, at the end of the shelf life and in every time point after shelf life.<\\/li><\\/ol>","ProtocolID":80}','https://wa.acibd.com/acihc/protocols','192.168.102.1','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'2026-04-13 06:04:12','2026-04-13 06:04:12'),
