(33,70,4,9,2,'Odazyth 500 F/C Tablets (Source: CSPC)','This protocol defines the procedure to conduct Stability Studies for Odazyth 500 F/C Tablets',NULL,'<p>QC Personal is responsible for:</p><ul><li>Preparation and review of stability protocol.</li><li>Collecting of sample provided by QA and storing stability samples.</li><li>Labeling of samples.</li><li>Initiation and withdrawal of samples.</li><li>Perform stability analysis.</li><li>Preparation of analysis report and trend data.</li><li>Initiating out-of-trend&nbsp;and out-of-specification investigation related to stability analysis (on requisite).</li><li>Initiating change control, deviation/incident related to stability analysis (on requisite).</li></ul><p>VD&amp;LCM is responsible for:</p><ul><li>Review of the protocol</li></ul><p>Head of QC or his/her designee</p><ul><li>Is responsible for to review and supervise the compliance with the PSSP</li><li>Is responsible for to review and supervise the compliance with the SOP</li></ul><p>QA is responsible for:</p><ul><li>Is responsible for review and final approval and to assure adherence to the PSSP.</li><li>Collection and transfer of sample from production to QC.</li><li>Is responsible for review and final approval and to assure adherence to the SOP</li></ul>','SOP of Stability Designing and Handling of Stability Protocol (000000650).','Analysis will be done as per stability specification and results shall be reported as per respective SOP (Testing and Reporting Result of Stability sample). Sample for testing shall be withdrawn within +2 working days of due date for up to six months, +5 working days for 9 and 12 months sample, within +10 working days for 18 months and later time points. Stability analysis should be initiated within 10 working days from the date of withdrawal and the analysis to be completed within 30 working days from start of analysis.','The laboratory raw data shall be reviewed and test results are to be evaluated against the established acceptance criteria. Stability trend analysis shall be reviewed as part of periodic product quality evaluation.','At the end of the Long-term and accelerated stability study a summary report shall be prepared with the conclusion on the stability under the packing conditions and terminate the stability study.','New Document',10009,'2025-10-12 08:28:50',NULL,'<ul><li>Additional Study Sample will be pulled out and tested only if needed.</li><li>Microbial &nbsp;enumeration test to be done at initial sample, at the end &nbsp;of the shelf life and in every year after shelf life.</li></ul>','000000650/5.02/9.1',NULL,NULL,'N','N','N','Source Change',NULL),
